    "title": "Where to watch Fanatics Flag Football Classic: Channel, live stream, time, TV schedule for game with Tom Brady, more",
    "text": "Where to watch Fanatics Flag Football Classic: Channel, live stream, time, TV schedule for game with Tom Brady, more originally appeared on The Sporting News. Add The Sporting News as a Preferred Source by clicking here.Tom Brady returns to action for what could be the next big sports event: the Fanatics Flag Football Classic.AdvertisementBrady, the multi-time Super Bowl champion, will be joined by co-captain Jalen Hurts and others on Founders FFC against Joe Burrow, Jayden Daniels, and others on Wildcats FFC.Outside of NFL players, the round-robin tournament will feature athletes and celebrities like Logan Paul, IShowSpeed, and Terence Crawford. Also competing: the U.S. men's national flag football team.The U.S. men’s national team hopes they have a fair shot at representing the U.S. at the Olympics in 2028. Can Brady, Saquon Barkley, Stefon Diggs, and others succeed against the flag football pros?The Sporting News has everything that you need to know about the Fanatics Flag Football Classic, including TV and live stream information.AdvertisementTV channel: FoxLive stream: FuboThe 2026 Fanatics Flag Football Classic will air live on Fox, with Kevin Burkhardt and Greg Olsen on the call.Fans can also stream the event live on Fubo, which offers a free trial, so you can try before you buy.Fubo offers a free trial for new subscribers, so you can try the service before you buy. Stream ESPN, ABC, CBS, Fox and 100+ top channels of live TV and sports without cable. (Participating plans only. Taxes and fees may apply.)When is the Fanatics Flag Football Classic?Date: Saturday, March 21Time: 4 p.m. ETThe Fanatics Flag Football Classic will start at 4 p.m. ET on March 21 from BMO Stadium in Los Angeles. The home of Los Angeles and Angel City FC can hold up to 22,000 people.AdvertisementFanatics Flag Football Classic rosters 2026Founders FFC rosterTom BradyJalen HurtsTerence CrawfordStefon DiggsRob GronkowskiDamar HamlinAshton JeantyAlvin KamaraVon MillerPatrick PetersonDeVonta SmithAntoine Winfield Jr.Wildcats FFC rosterJoe BurrowJayden DanielsDavante AdamsSaquon BarkleyOdell Beckham Jr.DeAndre HopkinsIShowSpeedDerwin James Jr.Kyle JuszczykLuke KuechlyLogan PaulJalen RamseyU.S. Men's National Team rosterAamir BrownTyler DavisDarrell “Housh” Doucette IIIVelton Brown Jr.Isaiah Calhoun,Ja'Deion HighNico CasaresJamie KennedyMike DanielsShawn Theard Jr.Laval DavisLaderrick Smith",
